## Want to add a new page?

Assuming that you are part of the Platform Operations Github Team, you can add a new page to this repository by:

- Creating a new `filename.html.md.erb` file within the [source directory](https://github.com/ministryofjustice/platform-operations/tree/main/source)
- Raising a pull request and getting a team member to review it (this is usually best achieved by reaching out in the internal team channel as listed towards the top of this document)
- Once you have merged the pull request, monitor the [publish](https://github.com/ministryofjustice/platform-operations/actions/workflows/publish.yml) github action

Once the Github Action has passed successfully, you should be able to see your page live on the [Platform Operations Runbooks](https://ministryofjustice.github.io/platform-operations/) site.

Please ensure your file contains the following at the top:

```
---
title: <The title of your page>
weight: <A number to determine the order of your page in the left-hand navigation panel>
last_reviewed_on: <When the page was last reviewed, in YYYY-MM-DD format>
review_in: x months ## How often the page should be reviewed, in months
---

<%%= current_page.data.title %>
```
